bluejetty:00071774:ios.description:
Text to Speech is an app that converts any text to speech and can read out loud in any language.
The app has large storage for creating your personal library. You can use it for different content of your choice: websites, emails, notes, e-books, PDF/TXT files and documents. To make it easy to use, the app features various options for adding text: you can type the text yourself or paste the copied fragment with unlimited characters, scan the required number of pages or add a photo from your gallery. The app will recognize the text and read it to you at a comfortable speed.
KEY FEATURES:
• Convert images to audio;
• Scan any text;
• Type text with the keyboard;
• Add website posts;
• Convert any text added to the library to audio;
• Scroll text automatically while reading out loud;
• Select playback speed, language and reader’s voice;
• Share any text from your library with friends.
Enjoy reading and save your time with our app.
Please choose from our standard subscription options below: 1-week subscription from $2.99; 1-month subscription from $5.99; 12-month subscription from $10.99. Prices may change depending on your country.
Privacy Policy: https://appliks.com/privacy-policy
Terms of Use: https://appliks.com/terms-of-use

